222
00:16:37,242 --> 00:16:38,577
Mustahil.

223
00:16:38,661 --> 00:16:40,412
Bagaimana mungkin kau menyebutku polos?

224
00:16:46,251 --> 00:16:47,294
Aku memukau.

225
00:16:52,132 --> 00:16:53,550
